  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tAnti-Money Laundering\n\t\tCapium AML\n\n### Biometric AML Checks\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Thu, 19 Jun, 2025 at  5:02 PM\n\n\t\tCapium now integrates with Veriphy to offer secure, biometric identity verification for individuals managing UK companies — including directors, people with significant control (PSCs), and company filers.\n\nThis service helps your firm meet new Companies House regulations, which require verification of a person’s identity using photographic ID (such as a passport or driving licence), matched against a live biometric (facial recognition) check.\n\nWith Capium + Veriphy, these checks are conducted seamlessly, securely, and in full compliance with AML legislation and Companies House expectations.\n\n Compliant – Meets new UK identity verification standards Secure – Uses bank-grade facial recognition technology Seamless – Integrated directly into your Capium dashboard\n\nYou can now perform AML biometric checks directly from Capium, without switching systems — giving you greater confidence in your compliance processes and helping your clients meet their obligations.\n\nLearn how to perform a Biometric Check in Capium\n\nStep-by-step article\n\nWatch this explainer video to understand the wider Companies House changes:\n\nCompanies House: New Identity Verification Rules (Video)\n\nTo stay compliant with Companies House changes, you may need to become an Authorised Corporate Service Provider (ACSP) - if you're acting on behalf of your clients.\n\nHere are key GOV.UK resources to help you register:\n\nHow to register as an ACSP\n\nBeing an ACSP – Your Responsibilities\n\nNot yet using Capium for AML? It’s easy to get started. \n\nHow to register with Capium to set up AML\n\nWhether you’re onboarding new clients or preparing for the identity verification rollout, our AML tools and Veriphy integration are here to help you save time, reduce admin, and stay compliant.\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000116723\">Anti-Money Laundering</a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000193271\">Capium AML</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">Biometric AML Checks\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Thu, 19 Jun, 2025 at  5:02 PM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<p data-end=\"596\" data-start=\"384\" style=\"font-family: Tahoma, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Capium now integrates with <strong data-end=\"422\" data-start=\"411\">Veriphy</strong> to offer secure, biometric identity verification for individuals managing UK companies — including <strong data-end=\"595\" data-start=\"522\">directors, people with significant control (PSCs), and company filers</strong>.</span></span></p><p data-end=\"596\" data-start=\"384\" style=\"font-family: Tahoma, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><br></span></span></p><p data-end=\"848\" data-start=\"598\" style=\"font-family: Tahoma, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;\">This service helps your firm <strong data-end=\"667\" data-start=\"627\">meet new Companies House regulations</strong>, which require <strong data-end=\"744\" data-start=\"683\">verification of a person’s identity using photographic ID</strong> (such as a passport or driving licence), matched against a live biometric (facial recognition) check.</span></span></p><p data-end=\"999\" data-start=\"850\" style=\"font-family: Tahoma, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;\">With Capium + Veriphy, these checks are conducted seamlessly, securely, and in full compliance with AML legislation and Companies House expectations.</span></span></p><p data-end=\"999\" data-start=\"850\" style=\"font-family: Tahoma, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><br></span></span></p><p data-end=\"1194\" data-start=\"1001\" style=\"font-family: Tahoma, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;\"> <strong data-end=\"1016\" data-start=\"1003\">Compliant</strong> – Meets new UK identity verification standards<br data-start=\"1063\" data-end=\"1066\"> <strong data-end=\"1078\" data-start=\"1068\">Secure</strong> – Uses bank-grade facial recognition technology<br data-start=\"1126\" data-end=\"1129\"> <strong data-end=\"1143\" data-start=\"1131\">Seamless</strong> – Integrated directly into your Capium dashboard</span></span></p><p data-end=\"1194\" data-start=\"1001\" style=\"font-family: Tahoma, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><br></span></span></p><p data-end=\"1398\" data-start=\"1196\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Tahoma, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;\">You can now perform AML biometric checks <strong data-end=\"1261\" data-start=\"1237\">directly from Capium</strong>, without switching systems — giving you greater confidenc